  "body": "All buyer's agents are welcome. \r\n\r\nA rare chance to secure 1,095sqm (more or less) of prime freehold land with huge subdivision potential (subject to Council and Watercare approval). Whether you're a developer, investor, or land banker, this property offers incredible long-term value in a sought-after Eastern suburbs location.\r\n\r\nAll underground services are already on-site, making future development more convenient and cost-effective. Whether you choose to develop now or land bank for the future, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nWhile a lovely family home currently sits on the site, the true value lies in the land-hold, develop, or build your dream project. With increasing demand for land in this area, securing a large site like this is a strategic move.\r\n\r\nThis property is zoned for Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College, offering access to great schooling opportunities-a key attraction for families and future buyers.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Howick Village and Highland Park Shopping Centre, you'll enjoy easy access to retail, dining, and essential services. Lloyd Elsmore Park provides fantastic recreational facilities, while Half Moon Bay Marina offers ferry access to the city. A short drive takes you to all Eastern beaches and scenic reserves, making this a perfect location for those who appreciate a great lifestyle. \r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare-secure your future with this premium landholding today!",
